Note: contains builtin — substring / list-membership / Map-key by runtime type
Say contains("hello world", "world")
Say contains("hello", "xyz")
Say contains([1, 2, 3], 2)
Say contains([1, 2, 3], 9)
prefs = Map with theme = "dark" and lang = "en"
Say contains(prefs, "theme")
Say contains(prefs, "missing")
